walking to it there may be items still in the pit that you would like to 
reach, or you might like to block some ranged nasty's line of sight.

So when standing on the edge of a pit use the '>' key (go downstairs) to 
enter the pit.

Roll a test against Dx, modified by encumbrance and if the result is a 
success then "you climb down into the pit" with no other ill effect, 
otherwise you fall into the pit as usual.

